**FREE

// test19 — SFLPAG must not exceed SFLSIZ: a subfile can't display more
// rows per page than it can ever hold. dspfc must reject this with a
// hard error, not just a warning — it's a structurally broken spec, not
// a stylistic issue.

RECORD BADSFL SUBFILE
  FIELD NAME1 CHAR(8) OUTPUT ROW(6) COL(2)
END-RECORD

RECORD BADCTL
  SFLCTL BADSFL
  SFLPAG(20)
  SFLSIZ(10)
  SCREEN SIZE(24 80)
END-RECORD
